      "type": "text",
      "text": "🔑 Fluxo de Autenticação\n(JWT)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔑 Fluxo de Autenticação (JWT)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aS",
      "created": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "68fb37dbd3f247bca3b7",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 244.375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c3d00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 571176183,
      "version": 59,
      "versionNonce": 867562367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789841859656,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1️⃣ Mobile envia POST /v1/auth/login {email,\nsenha}\n\n2️⃣ API valida credenciais e retorna\naccessToken (1h) + refreshToken (7d)\nassinados HS256\n\n3️⃣ Mobile guarda os tokens no SecureStore e\nenvia Authorization: Bearer <token> nas\npróximas chamadas\n\n4️⃣ JwtAuthenticationFilter valida\nassinatura/expiração e popula o\nSecurityContext\n\n5️⃣ @PreAuthorize checa o papel do usuário →\n200 OK ou 403 Forbidden",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ Mobile envia POST /v1/auth/login {email, senha}\n\n2️⃣ API valida credenciais e retorna accessToken (1h) + refreshToken (7d) assinados HS256\n\n3️⃣ Mobile guarda os tokens no SecureStore e envia Authorization: Bearer <token> nas próximas chamadas\n\n4️⃣ JwtAuthenticationFilter valida assinatura/expiração e popula o SecurityContext\n\n5️⃣ @PreAuthorize checa o papel do usuário → 200 OK ou 403 Forbidden",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aT",
      "created": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "03857c2b9b984305918d",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 285.999755859375,
      "height": 48.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1853146217,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 711087281,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789841779753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Legenda das setas:\n— preta: fluxo de dados/requisições\n– – laranja: fluxo de autenticação (JWT)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legenda das setas:\n— preta: fluxo de dados/requisições\n– – laranja: fluxo de autenticação (JWT)",
